    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d457">

                <pb facs="0639" n="559" sameAs="frus:frus1936v01/pg559"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.5151/1025a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Wilson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1936-09-25T15:00:00-04:00">September 25,
                            1936—3 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>370. From the Secretary of the Treasury for Cochran. I transmit to you below our
                    latest redraft<anchor n="36" xml:id="d457-f1"/> of the proposed simultaneous
                    declaration. You will observe that the proposed revisions of the Anglo-French
                    text submitted to us are slight. Will you ascertain at once whether this draft
                    is acceptable to the French government and whether it will modify its draft
                    accordingly. We are giving a copy to the British Embassy in Washington at once
                    with the request that they ask the British the same question.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>[Morgenthau]</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
